00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:31,920
And so, PVC pipes, part of the PVC requires vinyl chloride.

113
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:42,920
Not that those pipes are particularly carcinogenic, but the vinyl chloride could potentially be carcinogenic if an occupational exposure occurred.

