00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:18,920
And they're also associated with adenocarcinoma of the cervix.

164
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:23,920
And so these are some high yield viruses that are associated with tumors.

165
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:29,920
And you're going to hear about most of these viruses again when we do systemic pathology.

